sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Clients (new connections)
  participant A as gw-a (MASTER, prio 150)
  participant B as gw-b (BACKUP, prio 100)
  participant CP as Control plane
  rect rgb(255, 244, 214)
    Note over A,B: Normal: A sends VRRP adverts every 0.2 s (unicast)
    A-)B: advert
  end
  C->>A: requests via the VIP
  Note over A: VM dies, or Traefik fails the check twice (1 s apart)
  A--xB: adverts stop (or priority-0 advert on FAULT)
  Note over B: master-down timer expires
  B->>B: becomes MASTER, adds the VIP
  B-)C: gratuitous ARP (repeated)
  C->>B: next requests via the VIP
  B-)CP: heartbeat: MASTER (live_version N)
  Note over CP: one fresh MASTER: healthy.<br/>Two fresh MASTERs after a promotion: split brain alarm
  Note over A: A returns as BACKUP (nopreempt): no second flap
